# Primary file. VPLanet starts here. Run this from the directory that
# contains these files:
#
#   vplanet vpl.in
#
# You should then see four lines, ending in "Simulation completed."
# The history is written to marsdyn.mars.forward.

sSystemName marsdyn
iVerbose 2
bOverwrite 1
saBodyFiles sun.in mars.in

# Internal units. A negative number in mars.in is converted from a
# familiar unit (Earth masses, Earth radii, days, AU) into these.
sUnitMass solar
sUnitLength AU
sUnitTime YEARS
sUnitAngle d
sUnitTemp K

bDoLog 1
iDigits 6
bDoForward 1
bVarDt 1
dEta 0.01

# How far to integrate, and how often to write a row.
# 4.5e9 years is 4.5 billion years. 1e8 years is one row per 100 million years.
# The forward file will report time in billions of years (Gyr).
dStopTime 4.5e9
dOutputTime 1.0e8
